  "steps": [
    "From the initialized official blank template with zero documents/assets/registrations, create and ordinarily save the first definition through Studio.",
    "Create the exact official retry TXT and first behavior through Studio. Its saved parameters start empty. Explicit Add missing supplies exactly three String defaults; preview and Cancel leave every saved author byte unchanged.",
    "Create a saved custom Enter action, two-member assembly and Level HUD through their ordinary UI forms. No input map, member relationship or HUD is seeded by the harness.",
    "Explicitly Add missing again, select saved Level and start_retry by name, manually change the initializer to health3, then Check/Apply/ordinary Save/reopen. Only the behavior source changes in this final phase; the official TXT stays exact. The retained eight-document author workspace captures a valid two-scene plan for independent native verification."
  ],
